--------------------------------------------------------------------------

File:   frontend/components/wallet/AddToGoogleWalletButton.tsx
Owner:  Google LLC
Terms:  https://developers.google.com/wallet/generic/resources/brand-guidelines

The SVG geometry, gradients, brand colours and wordmark in that file are a
reproduction of Google's official "Add to Google Wallet" primary button
