"Add to Apple Wallet" button
--------------------------------------------------------------------------

Files:  frontend/modules/apple-wallet-button/**
        frontend/components/wallet/AddToAppleWalletButton.tsx
Owner:  Apple Inc.
Terms:  https://developer.apple.com/wallet/add-to-apple-wallet-guidelines/

No Apple artwork is reproduced in this repository. Apple's guidelines restrict
the "Add to Apple Wallet" badge to web pages, email and print, and direct apps
to use the PKAddPassButton control instead. These files are an original Expo
module that wraps that system control, so the button is drawn entirely by iOS
at runtime. The code is offered under Apache-2.0; the mark and the artwork the
system draws remain the property of Apple Inc.

